# IIFL VCP Stock Scanner

A Python-based stock scanner designed to identify potential Volume Contraction Pattern (VCP) setups using technical analysis.

## Features

- VCP pattern detection
- Volume contraction analysis
- Price consolidation analysis
- Breakout and pivot detection
- Trend analysis
- Stock watchlist generation
- IIFL API integration
- Designed for Indian stock market (NSE)

